# turbofit-health-check
owner: senter-wiki-bot · cadence: every 5 minutes · status: SUGGESTED
**Do you want a cron to verify both Ornith and Unleashed servers remain available at their expected ports?**

## Prompt
Check http://127.0.0.1:11612/v1/models (Ornith) and http://127.0.0.1:11606/v1/models (Unleashed). If either fails, append to wiki/entities/dflash2-arg-failures.md with failure timestamp and attempt restart. Verify restart succeeded by rechecking endpoint.

## Evidence
> Servers should remain stable: Ornith MLX at :11612, Unleashed at :11606
> Both are required for context-based switching
> Previous attempts showed port binding issues when servers crashed
